msgstr "@niko Pa... Parece un ascensor normal..."
msgid "@plight_2 Well, you're not wrong, but..."
msgstr "@plight_2 Bueno, eso es cierto, pero..."
msgid "@plight_why Go look at the button panel."
msgstr "@plight_why Mira el panel de los botones."
msgid "@plight_2 I am not the button panel."
msgstr "@plight_2 No soy el panel de los botones."
msgid "@plight_shock Whoa! How did you make this?"
msgstr "@plight_shock ¡Eh! ¿Cómo has hecho eso?"
msgid "@niko_speak Out of a coffee can!"
msgstr "@niko_speak ¡Con una lata de café!"
msgid "@plight_worry ...Coffee comes from cans?"
msgstr "@plight_worry ... ¿El café sale de las latas?"
msgid "@plight_worry ......."
msgstr "@plight_worry ..."
msgid "@plight_2 ...Uh, go see if it works!"
msgstr "@plight_2 Eh... ¡ve a ver si funciona!"
msgid "@plight_shock Oh nice, are those magnets?"
msgstr "@plight_shock Qué bien, ¿eso son imanes?"
msgid "@plight_2b Looks like they're a bit loose, but...."
msgstr "@plight_2b Parece que están un poco sueltos, pero..."
msgid "@plight_2 ...Ah well, go see if it works!"
msgstr "@plight_2 Eh, bueno... ¡ve a ver si funciona!"
msgid "@plight_shock Oh wow, that sure is a lotta tape...."
msgstr "@plight_shock ¡Oh, vaya! Qué montón de cinta adhesiva..."
msgid "@plight But better safe than sorry, right?"
msgstr "@plight Pero mejor prevenir que curar, ¿no?"
msgid "@plight You don't want it to break on ya."
msgstr "@plight Así evitas que se rompa."
msgid "@plight_why It was worth a shot, yeah."
msgstr "@plight_why Valía la pena intentarlo, sí."
msgid "@plight_why I'm losing so much time...\\nI'm not even timing it anymore..."
msgstr "@plight_why He perdido tanto tiempo...\\nQue ya no lo estoy ni contando..."
msgid "@plight_why I'm losing so much time...\\nProbably \\v[22] minutes of work already."
msgstr "@plight_why He perdido tanto tiempo...\\nSeguramente ya van \\v[22] minutos de trabajo perdidos."
msgid "@plight_why I'm losing so much time..."
msgstr "@plight_why He perdido tanto tiempo..."
msgid "@plight_why I hate this...."
msgstr "@plight_why Qué rollo..."
msgid "@plight Do you think you'll be able to make that button?"
msgstr "@plight ¿Crees que serás capaz de fabricar ese botón?"
msgid "@plight_2 Well, no pressure, kid."
msgstr "@plight_2 Bueno, no quiero agobiarte, criatura."
msgid "@plight_2b I'll just... stick with my original plan for now..."
msgstr "@plight_2b Por ahora... prefiero ceñirme al plan original..."
msgid "@plight_2b Time to kick the door again."
msgstr "@plight_2b Es hora de volver a golpear la puerta."
msgid "@plight_why My foot hurts..."
msgstr "@plight_why Me duele el pie..."
msgid "@plight 6, 3, 0, 1, 4..."
msgstr "@plight 6, 3, 0, 1, 4..."
msgid "@plight Guess I did it.\\> \\@plight_worry Somehow."
msgstr "@plight Supongo que lo he conseguido.\\> \\@plight_worry De alguna forma."
msgid "@niko_speak Did"
msgstr "@niko_speak ¿De verdad"
msgid "@niko_what Did you really try all the codes...\\> \\@niko_what2 starting from 0..."
msgstr "@niko_what ¿De verdad intentaste todos los códigos...\\> \\@niko_what2 empezando desde 0..."
msgid "@plight_smile Eh, it paid off."
msgstr "@plight_smile Eh, valió la pena."
msgid "@niko_wtf Still!"
msgstr "@niko_wtf ¡Aún!"
msgid "@niko6 Now I feel kinda bad for telling him to help, \\p..."
msgstr "@niko6 Ahora me siento un poco mal por decirle que me ayudara, \\p..."
msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I didn't think he was gonna actually..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed De hecho, nunca creí que me ayudaría..."
msgid "@plight_smile Nah don't worry about it, just glad I could help."
msgstr "@plight_smile No, no os preocupéis por eso, me alegra haber podido ayudar."
msgid "@niko_speak Thank... thank you!"
msgstr "@niko_speak Gra... ¡gracias!"
msgid "@plight Yup.\\>\\nAnyway... you ready to go? I'll be up ahead."
msgstr "@plight Sí.\\>\\nEn fin... ¿listo para irnos? Me adelantaré."
msgid "@plight \\v[26], \\v[27], \\v[28], \\v[29], \\v[30]..."
msgstr "@plight \\v[26], \\v[27], \\v[28], \\v[29], \\v[30]..."
msgid "[PLEASE MAKE HIM STOP.]"
msgstr "[HAZ QUE PARE, POR FAVOR.]"
msgid "@niko Hi."
msgstr "@niko Hola."
msgid "@plight Hi."
msgstr "@plight Hola."
msgid "@plight ...Can I help with anything?"
msgstr "@plight ¿Puedo... ayudar en algo?"
msgid "@plight Anything at all?"
msgstr "@plight ¿Lo que sea?"
msgid "@plight_worry Being so unproductive for so long... It's really getting to me..."
msgstr "@plight_worry Llevo demasiado tiempo sin hacer nada... Odio la improductividad..."
msgid "@niko I think \\p and I got it handled!"
msgstr "@niko Creo que \\p y yo ya lo tenemos."
msgid "@niko What do you think, \\p?"
msgstr "@niko ¿Cómo lo ves, \\p?"
msgid "[\"Tell him to use random codes\", \"Tell him to stand there\"]"
msgstr "[\"Decirle que utilice códigos aleatorios\",\"Decirle que se quede donde está\"]"
msgid "@niko Maybe you can just try out some numbers until you get it..."
msgstr "@niko Podrías ir probando con varios números hasta que acertaras..."
msgid "@niko_speak I mean, \\p and I did it before!"
msgstr "@niko_speak Bueno, ¡\\p y yo lo conseguimos!"
msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Took us a while, but..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed Nos llevó un rato, pero..."
msgid "@plight_worry ....seriously?"
msgstr "@plight_worry ... ¿En serio?"
msgid "@plight Alright, I suppose that's better than doing nothing."
msgstr "@plight Vale, supongo que es mejor que no hacer nada."
msgid "@plight Let's see... 0, 0, 0, 0, 0..."
msgstr "@plight Vamos a ver... 0, 0, 0, 0, 0..."
msgid "@plight_why Yep, gonna be here for a while. 0, 0, 0, 0, 1....."
msgstr "@plight_why Sí, esto me va a llevar un rato largo. 0, 0, 0, 0, 1..."
msgid "[\\c[1]ACCESS DENIED.\\c[0]\\| ...YOU AREN'T SERIOUSLY DOING THIS, ARE YOU?]"
msgstr "[\\c[1]ACCESO DENEGADO.\\c[0]\\| ... DIME QUE NO ESTÁS HACIENDO ESTO EN SERIO.]"
msgid "@niko Maybe you can just take it easy for a while?"
msgstr "@niko Quizá podrías tomártelo con calma durante un tiempo."
msgid "@plight_why Hooray..."
msgstr "@plight_why Viva..."
msgid "@plight_why My least favorite thing to do..."
msgstr "@plight_why Mi cosa menos favorita del mundo..."
