msgstr "@plight Ey, has vuelto..."
msgid "@plight_worry That... sure took you a while, huh..."
msgstr "@plight_worry Has... tardado bastante, ¿eh...?"
msgid "@niko2 Oh, shoot! You've been waiting this whole time?"
msgstr "@niko2 ¡Hala! ¿Has estado todo este tiempo esperando?"
