msgstr "@niko ¿Y... sujetando la puerta?"
msgid "@plight_worry Well I uh...\\.\\. didn't want to be rude..."
msgstr "@plight_worry Bueno, eh...\\.\\. No quería perder la buena educación..."
msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I'm sorry, I should've told you to go on ahead..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed Lo siento, debería haberte dicho que siguieras adelante..."
msgid "@plight Eh, don't worry about it."
msgstr "@plight Bah, no te preocupes."
msgid "@niko I'll need to push the button to open the doors."
msgstr "@niko Tengo que pulsar el botón para abrir las puertas."
msgid "[HELLO.]"
msgstr "[HOLA.]"
msgid "[THIS AREA IS UNAUTHORIZED FOR DEMO.]"
msgstr "[ZONA NO AUTORIZADA PARA LA DEMO.]"
msgid "[SORRY ABOUT THE INCONVENIENCE.]"
msgstr "[SENTIMOS LAS MOLESTIAS.]"
msgid "@niko ...Demo?"
msgstr "@niko ¿Demo...?"
